    "Details": "The Basilisk ProtoMech was designed and built by Clan Cloud Cobra to support their Elemental and OmniMech forces. Unlike most second generation Protos, the Basilisk has a relatively low top speed. The Basilisk mounts a 'Mech sized ER Medium Laser. Paired with the laser is a three tube LRM launcher used to soften up targets as the Basilisk unit closes. The only problem with this is the severely limited ammunition supply.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapons - Missile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.972</color></b>",
